      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Notes from Pi in the VRC Discord:\n\nEasy fix it turns out, CyanTriggers should work in the next SDK version.\n\nCyanTrigger hooks the assetbundle build callback directly to recompile, meaning it compiled after the signature was calculated. So the system was working as intended, in some sense, because something modified the code after the signature was done. Will just move the signing process after that as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
