  "details": "My world when uploaded with SDK 3.7.2b2 will eject users immediately out of the world as soon as it finishes loading. The screen goes black as it transitions from the load screen, at which point you are then kicked straight back to the loading screen for your home world.\n\nI've had to fix my world (obviously) by rolling back to beta 1, but I've left a copy of the broken version here:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_30dc07f2-f497-42ca-ba18-29e261c81cc7",
